      <enclosure url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/21/multimedia/21int-cartel-arrest-wtk-cjwm/21int-cartel-arrest-wtk-cjwm-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg" />
